  <name>Beardmore, Ontario</name>
  <desc>&lt;a href=&quot;http://books.google.com/books?id=BKpZAAAAMAAJ&amp;amp;pg=PA78&amp;amp;hl=cs&amp;amp;vq=%22Beardmore,+Ontario%22&quot;&gt;Strana 78&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;They were found, according to one report, while dynamiting on a mining claim near &lt;b&gt;Beardmore, Ontario&lt;/b&gt;. But another report says they were retrieved from &lt;b&gt;...&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;more pages:  &lt;a href=&quot;http://books.google.com/books?id=BKpZAAAAMAAJ&amp;amp;pg=PA78&amp;amp;hl=cs&amp;amp;vq=%22Beardmore,+Ontario%22&quot;&gt;Strana 78&lt;/a&gt;</desc>
