  <ele>0</ele>
  <name>Berlin</name>
  <desc>&lt;a href=&quot;http://books.google.com/books?id=BKpZAAAAMAAJ&amp;amp;pg=PA201&amp;amp;hl=cs&amp;amp;vq=%22Berlin%22&quot;&gt;Strana 201&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;The Margrave of Brandenburg shepherded weeping members of his court to the top of a little hill in &lt;b&gt;Berlin&lt;/b&gt;. Et cetera. Again we might ask what happened &lt;b&gt;...&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;more pages:  &lt;a href=&quot;http://books.google.com/books?id=BKpZAAAAMAAJ&amp;amp;pg=PA201&amp;amp;hl=cs&amp;amp;vq=%22Berlin%22&quot;&gt;Strana 201&lt;/a&gt;</desc>
