<wpt lat="4.63" lon="-74.089996">
  <ele>0</ele>
  <name>Bogota</name>
  <desc>&lt;a href=&quot;http://books.google.com/books?id=BKpZAAAAMAAJ&amp;amp;pg=PA346&amp;amp;hl=cs&amp;amp;vq=%22Bogota%22&quot;&gt;Strana 346&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;The Muisca Indians were one of the Chibcha tribes living in the highlands around &lt;b&gt;Bogota&lt;/b&gt;. They were sedentary farmers with no great authority or &lt;b&gt;...&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;more pages:  &lt;a href=&quot;http://books.google.com/books?id=BKpZAAAAMAAJ&amp;amp;pg=PA346&amp;amp;hl=cs&amp;amp;vq=%22Bogota%22&quot;&gt;Strana 346&lt;/a&gt;</desc>
