<wpt lat="18.959999" lon="72.819999">
  <ele>0</ele>
  <name>Bombay</name>
  <desc>&lt;a href=&quot;http://books.google.com/books?id=BKpZAAAAMAAJ&amp;amp;pg=PA134&amp;amp;hl=cs&amp;amp;vq=%22Bombay%22&quot;&gt;Strana 134&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;At sixteen he joined the East India Company which shipped him to &lt;b&gt;Bombay&lt;/b&gt;. There he worked as paymaster of the first grenadiers,&lt;br&gt;more pages:  &lt;a href=&quot;http://books.google.com/books?id=BKpZAAAAMAAJ&amp;amp;pg=PA134&amp;amp;hl=cs&amp;amp;vq=%22Bombay%22&quot;&gt;Strana 134&lt;/a&gt;</desc>
</wpt>
<wpt lat="-15.779999" lon="-47.909999">
  <ele>0</ele>
  <name>Brasilia</name>
  <desc>&lt;a href=&quot;http://books.google.com/books?id=BKpZAAAAMAAJ&amp;amp;pg=PA144&amp;amp;hl=cs&amp;amp;vq=%22Brasilia%22&quot;&gt;Strana 144&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;They did not grow by chance, as most cities do; they were planned as deliberately as &lt;b&gt;Brasilia&lt;/b&gt; or Salt Lake City and are just as predictable. &lt;b&gt;...&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;more pages:  &lt;a href=&quot;http://books.google.com/books?id=BKpZAAAAMAAJ&amp;amp;pg=PA144&amp;amp;hl=cs&amp;amp;vq=%22Brasilia%22&quot;&gt;Strana 144&lt;/a&gt;</desc>
