<wpt lat="50.830001" lon="4.329999">
  <ele>0</ele>
  <name>Brussels</name>
  <desc>&lt;a href=&quot;http://books.google.com/books?id=BKpZAAAAMAAJ&amp;amp;pg=PA420&amp;amp;hl=cs&amp;amp;vq=%22Brussels%22&quot;&gt;Strana 420&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;And so spectacular were these conversions that he was invited to perform in &lt;b&gt;Brussels&lt;/b&gt; before Maximilian Emmanuel, governor of the Spanish Netherlands. &lt;b&gt;...&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;more pages:  &lt;a href=&quot;http://books.google.com/books?id=BKpZAAAAMAAJ&amp;amp;pg=PA420&amp;amp;hl=cs&amp;amp;vq=%22Brussels%22&quot;&gt;Strana 420&lt;/a&gt;</desc>
