<wpt lat="42.34037" lon="-3.70383">
  <ele>0</ele>
  <name>Burgos</name>
  <desc>&lt;a href=&quot;http://books.google.com/books?id=BKpZAAAAMAAJ&amp;amp;pg=PA384&amp;amp;hl=cs&amp;amp;vq=%22Burgos%22&quot;&gt;Strana 384&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;wrote to somebody in &lt;b&gt;Burgos&lt;/b&gt;, and many wear silk clothing. &amp;quot;Of the richness of this country I do not write you because it is said to be so great that &lt;b&gt;...&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;more pages:  &lt;a href=&quot;http://books.google.com/books?id=BKpZAAAAMAAJ&amp;amp;pg=PA384&amp;amp;hl=cs&amp;amp;vq=%22Burgos%22&quot;&gt;Strana 384&lt;/a&gt;</desc>
