  <name>Cairo</name>
  <desc>&lt;a href=&quot;http://books.google.com/books?id=BKpZAAAAMAAJ&amp;amp;pg=PA130&amp;amp;hl=cs&amp;amp;vq=%22Cairo%22&quot;&gt;Strana 130&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;The stone was carted off to the Institut d&amp;#39;Egypte in &lt;b&gt;Cairo&lt;/b&gt;, which Napoleon had founded, where copies were made of the text and sent at once to France &lt;b&gt;...&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;more pages:  &lt;a href=&quot;http://books.google.com/books?id=BKpZAAAAMAAJ&amp;amp;pg=PA130&amp;amp;hl=cs&amp;amp;vq=%22Cairo%22&quot;&gt;Strana 130&lt;/a&gt;</desc>
