<wpt lat="37.605651" lon="-0.991293">
  <ele>0</ele>
  <name>Cartagena</name>
  <desc>&lt;a href=&quot;http://books.google.com/books?id=BKpZAAAAMAAJ&amp;amp;pg=PA355&amp;amp;hl=cs&amp;amp;vq=%22Cartagena%22&quot;&gt;Strana 355&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;No matter who was responsible, Belalcdzar was ordered back to Spain, but at &lt;b&gt;Cartagena&lt;/b&gt; he fell sick and died. Some member of the party bought a length &lt;b&gt;...&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;more pages:  &lt;a href=&quot;http://books.google.com/books?id=BKpZAAAAMAAJ&amp;amp;pg=PA355&amp;amp;hl=cs&amp;amp;vq=%22Cartagena%22&quot;&gt;Strana 355&lt;/a&gt;</desc>
